        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I'd call it mild. It's worse with my new watch strap. Oh, and a bit of redness. That's been about the same, two days.",
